          "level": 1,
          "text": "P07.4 + P09.1 — Independent Red-Team",
          "anchor": "p074-p091-independent-red-team",
          "githubAnchor": "p074-p091-independent-red-team",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8dc9d1b9c359"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 1 — the close gate itself: **BROKE (HIGH)**",
          "anchor": "attack-1-the-close-gate-itself-broke-high",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-1-the-close-gate-itself-broke-high",
          "stableAnchor": "h-52018da4c92e"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1a. Protocol-swap on resume — reproduced",
          "anchor": "1a-protocol-swap-on-resume-reproduced",
          "githubAnchor": "1a-protocol-swap-on-resume-reproduced",
          "stableAnchor": "h-72ffc47ac9ea"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1b. Same id, definition edited in place — reproduced",
