          "text": "Smallest fix",
          "anchor": "smallest-fix",
          "githubAnchor": "smallest-fix",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9295fa443f12"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 2 — raw-store-door forgery through the new gate: **BROKE as disclosed, plus an ignored cheap signal (MEDIUM)**",
          "anchor": "attack-2-raw-store-door-forgery-through-the-new-gate-broke-as-disclosed-plus-an-ignored-cheap-signal-medium",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-2-raw-store-door-forgery-through-the-new-gate-broke-as-disclosed-plus-an-ignored-cheap-signal-medium",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4350b0f67e52"
        },
        {
