          "githubAnchor": "the-cheap-signals-a-real-validation-leaves-that-nothing-checks",
          "stableAnchor": "h-61f84fadc48f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 3 — `show.mjs` render: **HELD**",
